     * code points are between {@code start} and {@code end}.</p>
     *
     * <p>If {@code letters} is true, it will only select characters from the set
     * that are letters. If {@code numbers} is true, it will only select characters
     * from the set that are digits. If both are true, it will select either
     * letters or digits.</p>
     *
     * @param count   the length of random string to create, measured in code points.
     * @param start   the inclusive start of the code point range
     * @param end     the exclusive end of the code point range
     * @param letters if {@code true}, generated string will only include letters
     * @param numbers if {@code true}, generated string will only include digits
